stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED: payment.confirmed / COD
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAYMENT_EXPIRED
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAYMENT_MISMATCH
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED
  CONFIRMED --> PREPARING
  CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED: đủ điều kiện
  PREPARING --> READY
  PREPARING --> CANCELLED: trước khi nấu
  READY --> COMPLETED: PICKUP
  READY --> SHIPPING: DELIVERY
  SHIPPING --> COMPLETED
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> REFUND_PENDING: đã PAID
  REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED: duyệt + hoàn tiền
  REFUND_PENDING --> CANCELLED: từ chối
